{
  "$comment": "Rivet diagnostic code registry. Compiler codes are assigned in rust/src/diagnostics.rs (tests/codes.test.ts keeps both in sync); language-service codes (RV2101, RV3101, RV7101, RV7102) in libs/language-core. Codes are never reused; retired codes stay listed. `docs` per code = the docs base + code (placeholder origin until the docs site is published).",
